  "releaseNotes": "10.0.14: Expose the cron-jobs-to-Hangfire sync surface for downstream consumers (accounting AccountingCore port). Adds CronExpressionBuilder (derives a 5-field cron expression from cronJob schedule fields), CronJobHangfireState (read-only Hangfire registration snapshot for admin UI), and cronJob model additions: [NotMapped] hangfire, inHoursList/inDaysList, and NextDateComputed. See applications PRs #1197/#1198.",
